Scrazzy, known as Old Man Scrazzy, is an old man of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]], raised in New Volcantum on [[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]]. He is bald at the crown with white hair and a broad white beard, and he moves hunched over his gear, checking it again and again and muttering that someone is trying to kill him. He reads the old Sundom tongue, studies their ruins, and works magic. His companion is [[People/Bob|Bob]], a floating head in a cloak who sees in the dark for him.
